      <h2 class="mb-8 max-w-[560px] font-serif text-[1.85rem] font-bold leading-[1.25] tracking-[-0.2px] text-foreground md:text-[2.1rem]" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/owi-dui-expungements-in-milan-mi.astro:aik6ls">
        For The First Time, Michigan Now Allows Expungements For First Offense OWI-DUI Convictions.
      </h2>

      <img
        class="mb-10 aspect-[2.1/1] w-full rounded-[3px] object-cover"
